        "original_id": "319f7dc1-3551-5967-865b-14681e4e402a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: London, United Kingdom\n- Organizations: Great Britain\n- Events: 2012 Summer Paralympics\n- People: Sarah Storey, David Weir, Stephanie Millward\n- Roles: host nation, cyclist, wheelchair athlete, swimmer\n\nFacts:\n- Great Britain competed as the host nation at the 2012 Summer Paralympics in London, United Kingdom, from 29 August 2012 to 9 September 2012.\n- Sarah Storey was born on 26 October 1977.\n- Sarah Storey is a British road and track racing cyclist and former swimmer.\n- At the 2012 Summer Paralympics, Sarah Storey won four gold medals.\n- At the 2012 Summer Paralympics, David Weir won four gold medals as a wheelchair athlete.\n- At the 2012 Summer Paralympics, Stephanie Millward won a total of five medals as a swimmer.",
